        - [APPLIED 2026-04-29] Fix wrong claims about the normal-vs-exact gap in Loop B
            - chapter.log line 27 and chapter.md line 32: "At n = 50, they agree to within 0.05 except at the very ends." Actual max | p_z minus p_exact | at n=50 is 0.110, more than twice the cited bound.
